    "text": "guttenbergpress.com\nwebsite\nMonona\nMFL MarMac Cross Country Preview: Team enthusiasm and camaraderie grows\n13 hours ago\nThe MFL MarMac cross country team includes (front, left to right) Payton Schultz, Jude Onken, Trace Moser, Adian Reynolds; (middle) Taryn Moser, Kennedy Bachman, Brynlee Fritz, Skylar Fisk, Evelyn Fritz, Emma Driscoll, Lauryn Sandstrom, Emma Grau, Brooklyn Landt, McKenna Kozelka; (back) assistant coach Megan Schellhorn, Charlotte Koether, Samantha Ruff, Kacie Picha, Mariah Moser, Cora Keehner, Jerica Wille, Brooke Donlon, Julia Grau and head coach Eric Koenig. Not pictured are Wolfgang Martins-Sabrina, Emma Koether, Charlotte Meyer and Aaliyah Corcoran. (Photo by Audrey Posten)",
